%% Phase2 / read / G-14 单条消息已读回执
%% Helix owners: ws/handlers/post_read.rs; port_reply/message_v3_read.rs; event/read.rs
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: postRead({channelId,postIds})
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_post_read", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Mobile FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_post_read", payload)
  else Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_post_read", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 去重 postIds，过滤当前用户自己发送的消息
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST post-read
  Host->>Go: read receipt admission
  Go-->>Host: 2xx admission（不伪造 readers）
  Go-->>WS: WS post_read/post_readers(authoritative members,event_seq)
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(post_read)
  E->>IM: dispatch read authority
  alt valid next event_seq
    IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(read bit/member set + cursor)
    Host->>DB: commit scoped read receipt
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet post/readers
    Host->>DB: readback ordered reader snapshot
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:read(viewer-local)
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:readers(absolute member snapshot)
    Sink-->>UI: Angular updates read indicator/readers
    Sink-->>FFI: batch raw read events
    Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw read events
  else duplicate, self-authored, or PersistErr
    IM-->>Sink: no terminal read event
  end
  Note over UI,Web: Angular 不生成/解析 readBits；已读状态只来自 Helix durable readback，重复提交必须幂等。
